-- a listener on a path
a second bind of the path: AddrInUse
accept_timeout: nothing in 30 ms, after at least that long: true
echoed [over a path]
echoed [line two]
bytes the server echoed: 20
the path is still there: true
connect with no listener behind the path: ConnectionRefused
connect to a path that is gone: NotFound
bind after the path was removed
-- a pair
b reads [from a]
a reads [from b]
read_timeout: nothing in 20 ms
a read after b is gone returns 0
-- paths that cannot be one
an empty path: InvalidInput
a path of 104 bytes: InvalidInput
connect to a path of 104 bytes: InvalidInput
a path with a NUL byte: InvalidInput
